title: '`pallet-accumulate-and-forward`: benchmark a successful forward in `send_native`'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The `send_native` benchmark measured a failed, rolled-back forward, so its weight counted reads
    only. It now asserts success, and the new `BenchmarkHelper` config item makes the destination
    reachable. Use `xcm_builder::TeleportForwarderBenchmarkHelper` for
    `TeleportForwarderForAccountId32`.
crates:
- name: pallet-accumulate-and-forward
  bump: major
- name: staging-xcm-builder
  bump: minor
- name: westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: bridge-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: collectives-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: coretime-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: people-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
